Relay local database design system.

# Purpose

The purpose of this document to define local database schemas and relationships to support offline first architecture.

---

# High Level Architecture

                 Local DB
                    │
       ┌────────────┼────────────┐
       │            │            │
      user   conversations   messages
                    │
                    │
                    ▼
                Server sync

---

# Schemas

---

## user

user {
id
username
display_name
avatar_url
updated_at
}

---

## conversations

conversations {
id
type
last_message_id
last_message_preview
last_message_at
updated_at
}

---

## conversation participants

conversation_participants {
conversation_id
user_id
unread_count
last_read_message_id
joined_at
}

### Relationships

`conversation_participants.conversation_id → conversations.id`

---

## messages

messages {
id
conversation_id
sender_id
client_id
content
status
created_at
}

---
